# Loan Hub – Loan Management System

## Project Overview
Loan Hub is a web-based loan management application designed to manage loan applications and related activities.

## Technologies Used
- Java
- JSP (JavaServer Pages)
- HTML
- CSS
- JavaScript
- MySQL
- Apache Tomcat
- NetBeans IDE

## Main Features
- Loan Application Management
- Employee Registration
- Advisor Registration
- Product Management
- Email Notifications

## Database
MySQL

